(text "External 1S protection PCB stays with the cell.\nCell + / - to B+ / B-. P+ to J1.1; P- to J1.2.\nDo not join B- to system GND. Confirm common-port charging." (at 20 78 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "9327d556-bc0b-5a1e-8084-f5abb477efee"))
