(text "BOTH 200k resistors fitted. 4.2V pack -> 2.1V ADC.\nC1 at U1. XIAO has no onboard A0 divider." (at 20 146 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "a7a7bf8f-de8d-5f4f-8d33-e5dc91a1f0e7"))
(text "03  SHARED PERIPHERAL POWER" (at 20 163 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left top)) (uuid "27ea430f-2607-5194-b1b4-be78a0c1f2c5"))
(text "LOW = on. R1 holds Q1 off at reset. Q1: G=1, S=2, D=3.\nSource is the lower pin here (3V3); drain is 3V3_SW.\nFirmware must not drive an unpowered peripheral high." (at 20 197 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "0454736f-9033-5eb1-b087-6f1013572653"))
(text "04  XIAO MODULE" (at 213 30 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left top)) (uuid "21a9b2f2-9be8-501f-85a4-1b7a57961bb9"))
(text "VBUS intentionally NC. USB-C on XIAO is the only charger.\nBAT+/-: short strain-relieved underside wires for prototype.\nModule footprint and antenna keepout must be verified before layout." (at 213 112 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "f2cbfa02-56fd-5d63-8d0e-8970767bc4cc"))
(text "05  PROBE / FILTER" (at 213 127 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left top)) (uuid "fbb3b180-93b1-5c11-9dfa-37a2d6001507"))
