(text "07  TEST POINTS" (at 20 212 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left top)) (uuid "72fa816b-f8de-5437-83ae-c891e52c2dac"))
(text "PROTOTYPE CAPTURE - NOT A FABRICATION RELEASE" (at 20 243 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left top)) (uuid "f8dd35b5-d438-5451-ada9-3cfafc2f47ad"))
(text "No on-carrier lithium protection or duplicate charger. Identify and insulate the external protection board.\nJ1/J2/J3 and U1 footprints are intentionally unassigned pending exact parts and mechanical checks.\nConfirm actual display controller, cable ESD requirements, enclosure clearances and charging access.\nBefore field use: polarity/continuity, ADC calibration, rail-off leakage, USB charging and 24-hour bench soak." (at 20 251 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "66a77651-a097-529e-87a7-a59fc708e264"))
